  "description": "The generic hearing room after the action: the question paused on the guide with its pause mark, the editable reason card and the response card open on the rail. A lens opens on one supplied card (a real enlarged copy of the same room coordinates) and one supplied datum is substituted: the state on that card (intervention raised ↔ response as supplied). The old value moves, unchanged, to a dock as \"was\"; the new value arrives; only its dependent state follows (the card's cue, ● ↔ ◆). The context returns with a neutral changed-datum marker. Fictional and illustrative; no grounds, rule, ruling, outcome, winner or hierarchy.",
